{"id":"608773","name":"红枣紫米面窝窝头","author":"筠旸JY","authorId":"7345450","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/608773/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"稻米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黑米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将稻米黑米小米一起放入破壁机里面，按粉碎键。","img":"images/608773/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"杂粮面就打好了。","img":"images/608773/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红枣洗净去核儿切成小块。","img":"images/608773/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"杂粮面放入大碗里面，倒入适量清水。","img":"images/608773/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用筷子搅拌成絮状。","img":"images/608773/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入红枣块儿。","img":"images/608773/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"一起揉匀，软硬度自己掌握，能成团就行。","img":"images/608773/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取适量面团揉匀。","img":"images/608773/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"捏成窝头状。","img":"images/608773/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"可以在手里蘸一点清水，更好操作。","img":"images/608773/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"入蒸锅。","img":"images/608773/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大火上汽后蒸二十分钟即可关火。","img":"images/608773/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/608773/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/608773/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/608773/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/608773/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/608773/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}